gstack-copilot (GitHub Copilot CLI port)
========================================

This plugin is a port of gstack to GitHub Copilot CLI.

Original work: gstack by Garry Tan
  https://github.com/garrytan/gstack
  Licensed under MIT

This port uses gstack's built-in 'hosts/copilot.ts' adapter system
to regenerate SKILL.md files for the Copilot CLI environment via
'bun run gen:skill-docs --host copilot'. No SKILL.md content is
modified by hand.

Port maintainer: Aviral Dua (Microsoft)
